    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/deece42b56ad60d579f06ebacc1413ac.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/deece42b56ad60d579f06ebacc1413ac.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/deece42b56ad60d579f06ebacc1413ac.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather all 6, and you can make any wish come true with the [Dragoon Ball].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become the talking snake, [Snake Boy], defeat enemies, and use the skill cards you steal from them to build a stronger deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your journey to fulfill your wish with the ultimate deck and uncover the secrets of the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/46378c41a07c6a6cd3cf51f00999ece9.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. </strong>Attack the enemy with an attack card!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/797db53ba57fcf64c58b3de55e6f621f.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/797db53ba57fcf64c58b3de55e6f621f.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/797db53ba57fcf64c58b3de55e6f621f.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack cards deal direct damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are generally classified into [Single Attack], which targets one enemy, [Multi-hit Attack], which deals multiple hits at once, and [Area Attack], which targets multiple enemies simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the card\u2019s attribute, they can deal [Physical / Magic / Composite] damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>2. </strong>Strengthen your strategy with support cards!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/d747566c1b6211da0e7d62f530794e02.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/d747566c1b6211da0e7d62f530794e02.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/d747566c1b6211da0e7d62f530794e02.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffSupport cards allow you to use various effects that assist in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to simple buffs, debuffs, and healing that support the battle, you can also perform more strategic plays such as searching for desired cards or disrupting the enemy's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>3. </strong>Counter the enemy's actions with a counter card!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/7568214d312a8035acc44dade94e71ba.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/7568214d312a8035acc44dade94e71ba.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/7568214d312a8035acc44dade94e71ba.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter cards are cards that can be activated by chaining to [a specific action of the enemy] during their turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They usually have effects that disrupt the enemy's actions or provide significant advantages, allowing you to more effectively counter the enemy's strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>4. </strong>Try using an Annihilation card with powerful effects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/2463a74e112a789dd3b651c7693eb057.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/2463a74e112a789dd3b651c7693eb057.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/2463a74e112a789dd3b651c7693eb057.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffAnnihilation cards are cards that disappear upon use, making them difficult to recycle, but they come with stronger effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While powerful on their own, their ability to disappear upon use allows you to compress your deck, making it easier to add the desired skills to your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>5. </strong>Use trigger and passive effects to expand your strategic options!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/dd0aa19ce3692a4004191987f3cb11f0.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/dd0aa19ce3692a4004191987f3cb11f0.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/dd0aa19ce3692a4004191987f3cb11f0.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffSome cards have trigger effects that can be activated when sent to the hand, deck, or graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are passive effects that continuously activate when the card is in specific locations like the deck, hand, or graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these special effects to think about the synergy between cards and strengthen your strategy!\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>6. </strong>Combine several cards to create a Union card with the strongest effects!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/c609eb2a7ccdbd5aa8331b77d6345c8e.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/c609eb2a7ccdbd5aa8331b77d6345c8e.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/c609eb2a7ccdbd5aa8331b77d6345c8e.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffDuring battle, you can combine several cards from your hand to synthesize a Union card with powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the materials and synthesize the ultimate card to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/4898987affa5243909f64dd7cc95fd63.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>1. </strong>Earn experience to enhance your stats and acquire powerful traits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/e86fe6af688752baf1dace435d92e3ab.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/e86fe6af688752baf1dace435d92e3ab.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/e86fe6af688752baf1dace435d92e3ab.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to level up and earn stat and trait points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the stat points to strengthen your character and spend the trait points to unlock special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>2. </strong>Strengthen your strategy by using items and artifacts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9e2c38e079505959ca5313d93907b4c0.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9e2c38e079505959ca5313d93907b4c0.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9e2c38e079505959ca5313d93907b4c0.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffEquip [items] that can be purchased from the shop and [artifacts] that can be obtained by defeating enemies to your quick slots, enhancing your battle support and expanding your strategic options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9051075eca93eeeb1e4a3dbd475b3b34.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>1. </strong>Analyze the characteristics of your enemies, strategize, and break their patterns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/3be4bfb8fac8c651b5a7cc87c59a669b.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/3be4bfb8fac8c651b5a7cc87c59a669b.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/3be4bfb8fac8c651b5a7cc87c59a669b.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy uses unique traits and cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the enemies' information, strategize, and break their patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>2. </strong>Embark on an adventure across the world, defeat enemies, and complete your journey to fulfill your wish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/09e7ff7329c4488e504a53b7bca258b8.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/09e7ff7329c4488e504a53b7bca258b8.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/09e7ff7329c4488e504a53b7bca258b8.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffWho is Snake Boy, and what happened in the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the enemies blocking your path, progress through the story, and listen to the exciting tale of Snake Boy's adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>3. </strong>Enjoy card battles with enemies you create yourself in the training ground!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/38662f8905a32f0cd186a55135bd7b8c.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/38662f8905a32f0cd186a55135bd7b8c.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/38662f8905a32f0cd186a55135bd7b8c.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffIn the training ground, you can customize the [stats] and [deck] of the enemies you've defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the strongest enemies and enjoy card battles beyond the limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/4668f730c929fe97029b141e9f5dd184.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/deece42b56ad60d579f06ebacc1413ac.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/deece42b56ad60d579f06ebacc1413ac.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/deece42b56ad60d579f06ebacc1413ac.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather all 6, and you can make any wish come true with the [Dragoon Ball].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become the talking snake, [Snake Boy], defeat enemies, and use the skill cards you steal from them to build a stronger deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your journey to fulfill your wish with the ultimate deck and uncover the secrets of the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/46378c41a07c6a6cd3cf51f00999ece9.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. </strong>Attack the enemy with an attack card!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/797db53ba57fcf64c58b3de55e6f621f.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/797db53ba57fcf64c58b3de55e6f621f.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/797db53ba57fcf64c58b3de55e6f621f.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack cards deal direct damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are generally classified into [Single Attack], which targets one enemy, [Multi-hit Attack], which deals multiple hits at once, and [Area Attack], which targets multiple enemies simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the card\u2019s attribute, they can deal [Physical / Magic / Composite] damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>2. </strong>Strengthen your strategy with support cards!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/d747566c1b6211da0e7d62f530794e02.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/d747566c1b6211da0e7d62f530794e02.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/d747566c1b6211da0e7d62f530794e02.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffSupport cards allow you to use various effects that assist in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to simple buffs, debuffs, and healing that support the battle, you can also perform more strategic plays such as searching for desired cards or disrupting the enemy's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>3. </strong>Counter the enemy's actions with a counter card!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/7568214d312a8035acc44dade94e71ba.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/7568214d312a8035acc44dade94e71ba.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/7568214d312a8035acc44dade94e71ba.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter cards are cards that can be activated by chaining to [a specific action of the enemy] during their turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They usually have effects that disrupt the enemy's actions or provide significant advantages, allowing you to more effectively counter the enemy's strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>4. </strong>Try using an Annihilation card with powerful effects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/2463a74e112a789dd3b651c7693eb057.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/2463a74e112a789dd3b651c7693eb057.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/2463a74e112a789dd3b651c7693eb057.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffAnnihilation cards are cards that disappear upon use, making them difficult to recycle, but they come with stronger effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While powerful on their own, their ability to disappear upon use allows you to compress your deck, making it easier to add the desired skills to your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>5. </strong>Use trigger and passive effects to expand your strategic options!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/dd0aa19ce3692a4004191987f3cb11f0.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/dd0aa19ce3692a4004191987f3cb11f0.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/dd0aa19ce3692a4004191987f3cb11f0.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffSome cards have trigger effects that can be activated when sent to the hand, deck, or graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are passive effects that continuously activate when the card is in specific locations like the deck, hand, or graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these special effects to think about the synergy between cards and strengthen your strategy!\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>6. </strong>Combine several cards to create a Union card with the strongest effects!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/c609eb2a7ccdbd5aa8331b77d6345c8e.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/c609eb2a7ccdbd5aa8331b77d6345c8e.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/c609eb2a7ccdbd5aa8331b77d6345c8e.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffDuring battle, you can combine several cards from your hand to synthesize a Union card with powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the materials and synthesize the ultimate card to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/4898987affa5243909f64dd7cc95fd63.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>1. </strong>Earn experience to enhance your stats and acquire powerful traits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/e86fe6af688752baf1dace435d92e3ab.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/e86fe6af688752baf1dace435d92e3ab.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/e86fe6af688752baf1dace435d92e3ab.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to level up and earn stat and trait points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the stat points to strengthen your character and spend the trait points to unlock special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>2. </strong>Strengthen your strategy by using items and artifacts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9e2c38e079505959ca5313d93907b4c0.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9e2c38e079505959ca5313d93907b4c0.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9e2c38e079505959ca5313d93907b4c0.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffEquip [items] that can be purchased from the shop and [artifacts] that can be obtained by defeating enemies to your quick slots, enhancing your battle support and expanding your strategic options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/9051075eca93eeeb1e4a3dbd475b3b34.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>1. </strong>Analyze the characteristics of your enemies, strategize, and break their patterns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/3be4bfb8fac8c651b5a7cc87c59a669b.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/3be4bfb8fac8c651b5a7cc87c59a669b.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/3be4bfb8fac8c651b5a7cc87c59a669b.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy uses unique traits and cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the enemies' information, strategize, and break their patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>2. </strong>Embark on an adventure across the world, defeat enemies, and complete your journey to fulfill your wish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/09e7ff7329c4488e504a53b7bca258b8.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/09e7ff7329c4488e504a53b7bca258b8.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/09e7ff7329c4488e504a53b7bca258b8.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffWho is Snake Boy, and what happened in the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the enemies blocking your path, progress through the story, and listen to the exciting tale of Snake Boy's adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ufeff<strong>3. </strong>Enjoy card battles with enemies you create yourself in the training ground!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/38662f8905a32f0cd186a55135bd7b8c.poster.avif?t=1738409462\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/38662f8905a32f0cd186a55135bd7b8c.webm?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/38662f8905a32f0cd186a55135bd7b8c.mp4?t=1738409462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeffIn the training ground, you can customize the [stats] and [deck] of the enemies you've defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the strongest enemies and enjoy card battles beyond the limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273070/extras/4668f730c929fe97029b141e9f5dd184.avif?t=1738409462\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Collect all six Dragoonballs to make any wish come true. Play as Snake Boy, a talking snake, defeat enemies, and steal their skill cards to build a stronger deck. Complete your journey with the ultimate deck, fulfill your wish, and uncover the secrets of the world!",
